# AI tooling working directories — must stay out of history.
# Once committed, removing these requires rewriting history and a force-push.
# NOTE: docs/task_packets/ is deliberately NOT ignored. A task packet is a
# reviewed contract that bounds what an AI task may touch (allowed paths, tests,
# evidence, stop conditions). It is referenced by `make task-check` and by
# tools/scripts/check_task_packet.py as its default input.
.claude/
.codex/
.cursor/
.aider*
.github/copilot-instructions.md
docs/superpowers/

# Internal planning: team structure, week gates, staffing and stop-loss decisions.
# Kept local. The public repo describes the system and its contracts, not the
# schedule or the org chart.
docs/product/

# Local run artifacts
data/raw/
data/processed/
data/reports/
runs/
*.log
